# Win32 UI

Before changing native UI, read `docs/ui-design-system.md` and follow `.cursor/skills/win32-ui/SKILL.md`.

- Viewer and Agent share one palette, fonts, and「浏览…」label; Viewer login uses split auth layout, Agent uses compact top-header config.
- Use design-doc tokens (`rd.color.*`, `rd.space.*`, `rd.font.*`); do not invent one-off RGB/padding.
- Scale layout + fonts for system DPI; do not enable Per-Monitor V2 without `WM_DPICHANGED`.
- Raw Win32 only (no Qt/ImGui for Win7 line). Update the design doc if tokens change.
